Z||000006||007DOUG||05-01-2000||12:09 AM||||Super X:<BR>  Bikini model !!!! Cool, I'm just a space down from you in 35. I'll be there on saturday only with a whole trailer load of parts.<P>Formula:<BR>  Its easy to find, just follow the traffic. I was just at Spring Carlisle yesterday. Took 1hr. 15 min from the exit ramp. (normaly a 5-10 min drive. But Spring Carlisle is HUGE.) You'll want to arrive early just in case. FYI: I'm coming from Wheeling, WV and its a 3 hr. drive for me.<P>Just a general comment...... I'm walking through the Spring Carlisle swapmeet & car corral and didn't see a single fiero item. NOT ONE.<P>    In addition to the antique autos, there seemed to be alot of mid-80's autos for sale like camaros/monte carlos/mustangs/and full sized chevy trucks. But nothing fiero related. Not even in the swap field. Why are the mid-80's starting a "comeback" for everything but the fiero? What gives???||||reg||12
